top to bottom direction
class SlideTutorController <<Java boundary>> {
+ask(documentId: UUID, number: Integer, body: SlideQuestion): AnswerResponse
}
class SlideQuestion <<DTO>> {
+question: String
}
class SlideTutorService <<Java control>> {
+ask(userId: UUID, documentId: UUID, number: Integer, question: String): AnswerResponse
}
class MaterialAccessPolicy <<Java policy>> {
+authorize(userId: UUID, documentId: UUID, number: Integer): SlideScope
}
class AiClient <<HTTP adapter>> {
+askSlide(scope: SlideScope, question: String): AnswerResponse
}
class SlideTutorPipeline <<Python control>> {
+run(scope: SlideScope, question: String): AnswerResponse
}
class SlideScope <<DTO>> {
+documentId: UUID
+documentVersion: Integer
+courseOfferingId: UUID
+currentSlide: Integer
+allowedSlideNumbers: Integer[]
}
class GroundingValidator <<Python service>> {
+validate(answer: GeneratedAnswer, evidence: EvidenceSet): ValidationResult
}
SlideTutorController ..> SlideQuestion
SlideTutorController --> SlideTutorService
SlideTutorService --> MaterialAccessPolicy
MaterialAccessPolicy ..> SlideScope
SlideTutorService --> AiClient
AiClient ..> SlideTutorPipeline : internal HTTP
SlideTutorPipeline --> GroundingValidator
note bottom of MaterialAccessPolicy
Kiểm tra enrollment / publication / READY
trước lời gọi AI và trước khi trả nội dung.
end note
@enduml
